<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
        .highlight { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4A90E2; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to Esports!</h1>
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        <p>Thank you for registering with us!</p>
        <p>We have successfully received your data and your profile has been created.</p>
        <br/>
        <p>Your temporary password is:</p>
        <p class="highlight">{{password}}</p>
        <p>Please log in and change your password as soon as possible.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
